MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_001: Come. On. How many times do I have to say it?\nI didn't steal anything.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_002: No! You stole my jewelry! I knew a Dyan\nsupporter couldn't be trusted.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_003: I don't see what my family's faction has to do with\nwhether I stole something.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_004: Ha! You are a traitor's daughter after all. Who else\nwould worm their way in and start stealing?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_005: You're as shameless as everyone says!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_006: Say that again. I dare you.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_007: SHUT UP! BOTH OF YOU!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_008: Huh?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_009: How come you two gotta spoil a beautiful day with\nall this yapping?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_010: Commander Tobias! I-I'm so sorry!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_011: What about the jewelry? Ugh... Guess she was just\nlooking for a fight.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_012: That's better. Nice and quiet.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_013: Hey, uh, Tobias? Thanks. I mean it.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_014: Thanks for what? Who are you again?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_015: I'm Lilian. One of the troops. Thanks for sticking\nup for me.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_016: A lotta folks like her refuse to trust anyone with\nthe slightest ties to Dyan.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_017: Which is fine, I guess, but I'm sick of them getting\non my case about it. So I owe you one.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_018: Oh. I was just pissed off 'cause you were spoiling\nmy nap. *yawn* But now I get to sleep in.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_019: What, right here on the grass?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_020: Uh, sure. Where else?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_021: I can make a bed for you. All I need is some grass,\nbranches, and a few minutes.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_022: What?! Just like that?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_023: Let's just say I've learned to get creative to save\nsome coin here and there.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_024: That'd be a huge help! You're a good soldier, Lil.\nBaw haw haw!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_025: It's "Lilian." Look, this isn't me being nice.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_026: I don't like owing people, so this is my way of paying\nyou back.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_027: Whatever you say! Grass and branches, right? I'll go\nget some for you!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_028: Hyeh! Hragh! Haah!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_C_029: Doesn't a commander have people for that?\nWhat a weirdo.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_001: So what does one of Theodora's retainers want with\nme out in the middle of nowhere?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_002: If you brought me here to take me out, you oughta\nknow I give as good as I get.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_003: Yeah, so I hear. They say you're so good you hit\nyour mark a hundred times out of a hundred.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_004: Which is why I brought you out here so we can\ngo hunting!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_005: Oh. That's it?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_006: Yup. You're an archer, you know how to set up\ncamp... The perfect hunting buddy!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_007: Well, I can't make camp from nothing. But I did hunt\na lot when I was younger.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_008: Great! Today's the day I finally bag one of those\nspeedy Dagdan pheasants!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_009: Now that I got you, it's as good as ours.\nStick close, Lil!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_010: I told you it's "Lilian." Are you sure about this?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_011: What's the matter? Forget something?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_012: The dirt on my name tends to rub off on whoever\nI hang out with.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_013: Even one of Queen Theodora's aides won't come\naway clean.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_014: People like me, whose houses sided with Dyan,\nare bad news. Everyone says so.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_015: Huh. OK. That political stuff goes over my head.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_016: Weren't you listening? I just explained it all!\nAre you really sure you want to be around me?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_017: Don't worry about that. Worry about how we're\ngonna catch this pheasant!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_018: I didn't say I was worried about you. I'm just...
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_019: Huh? Which way is it, then? Well, whatever!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_020: We better get hunting before it's dark, or we won't\nhave any pheasant stew for supper!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_021: Baw haw haw!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_022: *sigh* I'm thinking too hard about a guy who doesn't\nthink about anything.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_B_023: But I guess that's better than the alternative.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_001: Soft grass...clear sky... This is the life.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_002: Yeah...you can say that again.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_003: *snore*
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_004: Oh, are you asleep? *yawn* Maybe I'll take a little\nnap too.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_005: Huh?!
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_006: Hey, look who's up. We still got some leftovers from\nyour pheasant stew. Want any?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_007: How long was I asleep?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_008: Check the sky and see for yourself. You were out\nlike a light.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_009: Whew... I was exhausted. You know, I feel a lot more\ncomfortable around you these days.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_010: You were uncomfortable before? Aww, there was no\nneed for that.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_011: Yeah, I know that now. But when you first called for\nme, I didn't know what I was in for.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_012: I needed a hunting buddy. You're good with a bow\nand handy around a campsite. Easy.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_013: A man and a woman...together...and all this\nguy can think about is hunting?
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_014: *slurp* What's the matter? If you don't want the rest\nof your stew, I'll take it.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_015: Listen. I know how I act, but I was born into a pretty\nrespectable house.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_016: Before it all went south, men were lining up to ask\nmy folks for my hand in marriage.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_017: Once I get my estate back, maybe I'll invite you over\nfor a feast.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_018: Estate? Feast? Hm.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_019: Unbelievable.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_020: Nah, I'm good with a soft grass bed and some stew.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_021: Anyone who can make those is already amazing.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_022: *slurp* Ahhh. Deeelish! Y'know, Lil, pheasant stew\ntastes best eaten in the wild.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_023: It's "Lilian." You know this. You really are\nclueless with women.
MID_SE_Tob_Lil_A_024: But don't ever change. I like you fine just the way\nyou are.